pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Regression test: same degree underflow as pol_weaken_degree_underflow, but on the
% `Cardinality` representation, which stores its degree in an i64 as well.
f 2 ;
rup 1 x1 1 x2 >= -9223372036854775808 ;
pol 3 x1 w x2 w ;
output NONE;
conclusion UNSAT : 4 ;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
